{
  "name": "ordering: a return for an order loyalty has not seen is ORDER_UNKNOWN, then accepted once the order exists",
  "note": "Member in BRONZE, earnMultiplier 1, no promotion. Step 1 returns order O-13001 before loyalty has it: the endpoint answers 422 ORDER_UNKNOWN, grants nothing and writes nothing, so expectedPoints and expectedLedgerDelta are null. Step 2 records O-13001 with one line of amount 2000: 2000 x 1 = 2000; 2000 / 100 = 20 points, so expectedPoints 20 and expectedLedgerDelta +20. Step 3 retries the same return R-13001 for 1000: the order's new worth is (2000 - 1000) x 1 = 1000; 1000 / 100 = 10 points; the clawback is 20 - 10 = 10, so expectedPoints 10 and expectedLedgerDelta -10.",
  "program": {
    "currency": "USD",
    "currencyUnit": 100,
    "timeZone": "America/New_York",
    "expiryMonths": 12,
    "expiryNoticeDays": 30,
    "tierWindowMonths": 12
  },
  "tiers": [
    {
      "code": "BRONZE",
      "minSpend": 0,
      "earnMultiplier": 1
    },
    {
      "code": "SILVER",
      "minSpend": 100000,
      "earnMultiplier": 1.5
    },
    {
      "code": "GOLD",
      "minSpend": 500000,
      "earnMultiplier": 2
    }
  ],
  "promotions": [],
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "return",
      "orderRef": "O-13001",
      "returnRef": "R-13001",
      "body": {
        "occurredAt": "2026-03-24T12:00:00Z",
        "lines": [
          {
            "lineNo": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "amount": 1000
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedStatus": 422,
      "expectedPoints": null,
      "expectedLedgerDelta": null,
      "expectedError": "ORDER_UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "call": "order",
      "orderRef": "O-13001",
      "body": {
        "externalRef": "M-13001",
        "currency": "USD",
        "occurredAt": "2026-03-24T13:00:00Z",
        "storeCode": "ST-13",
        "channel": "POS",
        "lines": [
          {
            "lineNo": 1,
